  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="14b554eb-4094-5891-b7c6-84fc304349a2" activityNameId="f200d8ad-11d8-5b54-b59a-4823a906dd26" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Power sawing, without catalytic converter, holzpur</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Power sawing, without catalytic converter, holzpur
All measured emissions are taken from an old (1993) EMPA report. The type of power saw probably does not correspond to the type described in the infrastructure, but this discrepancy can be accepted. Data on the use of fuel and lubricating oil are specific for the Korporation Giswil, which delivers the wood to Walter Küng AG for the production of holzpur elements. Lubricating oil is modelled by soya oil. Correcting modules for the transport of soya oil are applied. Air and oil emissions are scaled to the use of fuel and lubricating oil.;
UUID: b00ca865-2cee-3c7a-971b-d15a6b200175
Includes the power saw (infrastructure), fuel use, lubricating oil and some measured air emissions (including emissions from combustion of the fuel).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at the Korporation Giswil in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b00ca865-2cee-3c7a-971b-d15a6b200175.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
